  "description": "The Smok Mavic RF Pro Vape Kit combines sleek design with user-friendly functionality, making it an excellent choice for both beginners and seasoned adult vapers. This kit features a 1000mAh built-in battery, providing ample power for a full day of vaping, and can be quickly recharged via USB-C. The device is equipped with a 2ml refillable pod, which uses a side-fill system for easy refilling and a 0.8ohm mesh coil for enhanced flavour and vapor production. The Mavic RF Pro is draw-activated, eliminating the need for buttons, and simplifying the vaping process. Its compact and lightweight design, constructed from durable zinc alloy, ensures it is both portable and robust. The device operates within a wattage range of 5W to 30W, allowing and a handy OLED display provides clear information on battery life, wattage, and coil resistance. When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil. Match your kit with a UK vape liquid designed to bring out the best in every puff. We recommend using 50/50 or Nic Salt E-Liquid with this kit. Please Note: USB-C Cable Sold Separately",
